</center><H1 ALIGN=CENTER> Wizard Guild Info</H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>
<pre>

Info posted March, 2006.


Name: The Brotherhood of Wizardry
Command: mage
Creators: Alaron and Ulax
Maximum level: 35


Description:
Wielding the powers which are the foundations of our existence, mages
have always been regarded with respect and fear. The brotherhood of
wizardry defines the path through which these powers can be harnessed
to one's will.


Joining requirements:
 Background must be magical (wrong or incomplete)
Abilities gained when joining:
 May study spell Darkness to 20%
 May study spell Heal self to 20%
 May study spell Floating to 20%
 May study spell Invisibility to 10%
 May study spell Light to 20%
 May study spell Moon sense to 20%
 May train skill Attack to 9%
 May train skill Cast heal to 9%
 May train skill Cast generic to 9%
 May train skill Consider to 19%
 May train skill Damage criticality to 9%
 May train skill Essence eye to 19%
 May train skill Short blades to 9%
 May train skill Mana control to 9%
 Receive the Robes of Wizardry
 Receive the reward for continuing your studies


Abilities and requirements at each level:
 Level 2:
  Requirements:
   Has trained skill Essence eye to at least 20% (passed)
  Abilities:
   May study spell Darkness to 40%
   May study spell Heal self to 40%
   May study spell Floating to 40%
   May study spell Floating letters to 40%
   May study spell Invisibility to 20%
   May study spell Light to 40%
   May study spell Moon sense to 40%
   May study spell Word of recall to 10%
   May train skill Attack to 19%
   May train skill Cast heal to 19%
   May train skill Cast generic to 19%
   May train skill Consider to 38%
   May train skill Short blades to 19%
   May train skill Mana control to 19%


 Level 3:
  Requirements:
   Has trained skill Cast generic to at least 20% (passed)
  Abilities:
   May study spell Chill touch to 10%
   May study spell Darkness to 60%
   May study spell Disruption to 10%
   May study spell Flame arrow to 10%
   May study spell Floating to 60%
   May study spell Heal self to 60%
   May study spell Invisibility to 30%
   May study spell Light to 60%
   May study spell Magic missile to 10%
   May study spell Moon sense to 60%
   May study spell Shocking grasp to 10%
   May study spell Thorn spray to 10%
   May study spell Vacuumbolt to 10%
   May study spell Word of recall to 20%
   May train skill Attack to 28%
   May train skill Cast heal to 28%
   May train skill Cast generic to 28%
   May train skill Consider to 57%
   May train skill Essence eye to 38%
   May train skill Short blades to 28%
   May train skill Mana control to 28%


 Level 4:
  Requirements:
   Must pass 1 out of the following:
    Has studied spell Light to at least 40% (passed)
    Has studied spell Darkness to at least 40% (at 22%)
    (passed)
   Has trained skill Cast generic to at least 30% (passed)
  Abilities:
   May study spell Chill touch to 15%
   May study spell Darkness to racial maximum
   May study spell Disruption to 15%
   May study spell Heal self to racial maximum
   May study spell Flame arrow to 15%
   May study spell Floating to 80%
   May study spell Floating letters to 60%
   May study spell Invisibility to 40%
   May study spell Light to racial maximum
   May study spell Magic missile to 15%
   May study spell Moon sense to 80%
   May study spell Shocking grasp to 15%
   May study spell Thorn spray to 15%
   May study spell Vacuumbolt to 15%
   May study spell Word of recall to 30%
   May train skill Attack to 38%
   May train skill Cast acid to 19%
   May train skill Cast asphyxiation to 19%
   May train skill Cast cold to 19%
   May train skill Cast electricity to 19%
   May train skill Cast fire to 19%
   May train skill Cast generic to 38%
